Third-party code
----------------

The change summary on fold rows (0.8.0) adapts code from paseo-chat-polish by Hieu Le
(https://github.com/lthieu96/paseo-chat-polish). shared/changes.ts and summarizeChanges in
shared/fold.ts follow changeSummary in its shared/recap.ts (lines changed per file, paths
relative to the agent's directory, the exit code in Claude Code's error text, the first line
of a failed command). shared/diffstat.ts follows the Diffstat component in its
client/views.tsx (five squares split between added and removed lines). That code is used
